{"id":21065,"name":"今日好手气","rarity":4,"path":"Elation","desc":"欢愉命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","story":"<i>「师妹，你确信无疑？」</i>\\n<i>「哼，绝无错漏！」</i>\\n<i>「这次的赌注可不止一瓶护手霜哦。」</i>\\n<i>「如此简单的游戏…岂会有变数？」</i>\\n粉发女孩转过身，拒绝再受其扰。\\n\\n<i>「以茶叶浮沉的迹象来看，师妹你该出那张才是。」</i>\\n少女抽签，反转出示——\\n<i>「呀，我的好手气来了。」</i>\\n<i>「再来再来，这绝对不可能……」</i>\\n……\\n\\n女孩忘了和师姐玩过多少占卜游戏，只记得师姐总愿意陪她重来。\\n后来，女孩想要逃离命定的预言，不顾阻挠，去往了罗浮太卜司。\\n初到罗浮，她忽然从卜书的夹缝中发现一枚精致的符签，熟悉的笔迹让在异乡的女孩红了眼眶：\\n\\n<i>「谁说命运没有第二种可能？我的转运符，送给你咯~」</i>","max_promotion":6,"max_rank":5,"skill":{"id":21065,"name":"抉择","desc":"使装备者的暴击率提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#1[i]%</unbreak></color>。装备者施放欢愉技时，欢愉度提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#2[i]%</unbreak></color>，该效果最多叠加<unbreak>#3[i]</unbreak>次。","level":{"1":{"level":1,"param_list":[0.12,0.12,2]},"2":{"level":2,"param_list":[0.14,0.14,2]},"3":{"level":3,"param_list":[0.16,0.16,2]},"4":{"level":4,"param_list":[0.18,0.18,2]},"5":{"level":5,"param_list":[0.2,0.2,2]}}},"stats":{"0":{"hp_base":43.2,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":24,"attack_add":3.6,"defence_base":18,"defence_add":2.7,"max_level":20,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":4000},{"ItemID":116001,"ItemNum":5}]},"1":{"hp_base":95.04,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":52.8,"attack_add":3.6,"defence_base":39.6,"defence_add":2.7,"max_level":30,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":8000},{"ItemID":110261,"ItemNum":3},{"ItemID":116001,"ItemNum":10}]},"2":{"hp_base":164.16,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":91.2,"attack_add":3.6,"defence_base":68.4,"defence_add":2.7,"max_level":40,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":16000},{"ItemID":110262,"ItemNum":3},{"ItemID":116002,"ItemNum":6}]},"3":{"hp_base":233.28,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":129.6,"attack_add":3.6,"defence_base":97.2,"defence_add":2.7,"max_level":50,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":40000},{"ItemID":110262,"ItemNum":6},{"ItemID":116002,"ItemNum":9}]},"4":{"hp_base":302.4,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":168,"attack_add":3.6,"defence_base":126,"defence_add":2.7,"max_level":60,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":80000},{"ItemID":110263,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":116003,"ItemNum":5